# Primeval Park's raptor burrow (CIPlay primeval_park_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: the new knoll hw_mount at 55 50 (b 16, h 16); kit_dig mouth at 38 50 (yaw 90: way in = +x), 3 m level, 10 m on,
# a room at the end (~51..57); the sign ppburrowsign at 30 45; two hyenas inside; zone pp_burrow at 47 50. Floor 3.52 (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Primeval Park keep
offset -11.3586 -2.7132
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the burrow's mouth from the paddock
picture pp_burrow_out 30 +3 50 38 +1.5 50
read RAPTOR BURROW

# The "raptors" (11-12 mixed monsters): two hyenas, inside
wait 3
expect animals Hyena 2
expect animalsinside Hyena 2
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0

# In to the chamber
walk 31 47 to 34 50 to 38 50 to 41 50 to 47 50
zone pp_burrow
picture pp_burrow_in 43 +2.5 50 54 +0.5 50 light=20
walk 47 50 to 41 50 to 38 50 to 34 50
